    "targets": {
      "value": "1 ripe berry"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You imbue the target berry with the bounty of nature, turning it into a goodberry that can heal and sustain far beyond its normal capacity. A creature can eat the goodberry with an Interact action to regain 1d6+4 Hit Points. A berry not consumed during the duration withers away. Every six goodberries consumed gives as much nourishment as one square meal for a typical human."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): You can target an additional berry. A creature can consume any number of goodberries from the same casting with a single Interact action."
    },
